00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.450
Mitsuboshi Jump!

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.910
Colors

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:36.540
Let's find a new member for Colors.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:38.700
What? A new member?

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:39.790
Why?

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:42.540
Because there's something we lack!

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:45.000
We need a straight man.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.580
We don't need a straight man. I'm already good at that.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.790
Okay, Yui. Be the straight man. I'll be the funny man.

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:52.700
What about me?

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:53.290
Huh?

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.000
What role do I play?

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.660
Koto-chan can be...

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:00.580
the enabler.

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:01.540
Enabler?

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:03.040
Yes, the evil influence.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.410
Oh, I like that.

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:08.500
Okay, Yui's the straight man.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:09.500
Yeah!

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.330
Koto-chan's the evil influence.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:12.500
Mhm.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.750
And I'm the funny man.

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.660
The sofa flew so-far away!

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:20.330
With all the people still on it! 

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:22.250
They died, of course!

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:24.870
B-but why?!

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:32.000
I-I know I wouldn't want to see a crime scene

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:32.000
full of couch cushions and dead bodies!

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.410
So where do we find this new member?

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:38.910
I know just the place!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.160
And so today...

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.580
...we're going to the museum!

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.200
Ticket Counter 1

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.200
Ticket Counter 2

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.200
High School

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.200
and Younger

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.200
Free

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.120
Free

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.410
Even high school students get in free?

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:00.870
What do we do?

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:04.160
The zoo lets grade school kids in free,

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:04.160
but this is even cheaper.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.540
Does that mean...?

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:10.620
The animals at the zoo were okay,

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:10.620
but there's no doubt about it this time.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:14.500
They're not feeding any of their exhibits here!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.080
That's a serious case!

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:20.410
All the exhibits here are dead.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.200
Oh, right!

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:26.250
They're all dead!

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.250
We're coming for you, new member!

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:39.830
Hey, Sat-chan.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.790
If they're all dead, why are we looking for

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.790
a new member here?

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.700
Don't you know, Yui?

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:49.580
All the exhibits at the museum come to life at night.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.000
I saw it on TV!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.200
Oh!

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:56.250
So they can protect the town at night in our place.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:56.250
That's perfect!

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.500
Exactly!

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.160
I get it now! You're so smart, Sat-chan!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.290
What's wrong, Sat-chan?

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:04.830
I saw something!

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.580
It's so big!

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.040
Awesome.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:21.750
I never dreamed we'd find

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:21.750
such an incredible weapon here!

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.660
Huh? This is a weapon?

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.790
If you use this, you can fire a missile

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.790
whenever you want!

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.790
But fire it at what?

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.250
I don't know.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.200
Let's just go with Saito!

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:39.540
I kinda feel sorry for him.

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:42.450
No, I'm not sure there's any need for sympathy.

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:45.330
It's possible this belongs to Saito.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.160
What?

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:48.290
He's a dog of the state.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.700
I wouldn't be surprised if he at least had one of these.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.160
I see.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.450
A weapon this awesome is wasted on Saito!

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.290
Let's steal it!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.000
Huh? He's gone.

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:19.580
My cuteness helped us through!

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:24.290
We got in trouble.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.000
So much for making it through.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.580
Oh well. We're looking for a new member!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.200
Here we go! The Global Gallery!

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:31.160
Global Gallery.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.450
Global Gallery!

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.370
It's a dinosaur!

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:42.540
If they have dinosaurs,

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:42.540
they must have EVERYTHING at the museum!

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:45.620
But I thought it'd be bigger.

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.450
Wait, you haven't been here before, Sat-chan?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.410
What? You guys have?

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:51.160
Yes.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.160
I have!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:57.120
I came with my school in first grade.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:00.700
But I was so scared from the bones everywhere

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:00.700
that I don't remember anything.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:03.080
I was playing my game. I didn't see anything.

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:06.370
So nobody remembers anything!

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:08.500
It's an elephant!

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:10.830
A piti-phant!

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.750
What? This is one of them?!

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.950
Is that you, piti-phant?

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.750
Is this where you've been?

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.950
You really didn't get any food.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:22.910
If only we'd made it here sooner.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:29.160
I know! Let's make the piti-phant part of our team!

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:31.000
I don't know about that.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.540
I'd prefer a dinosaur.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.000
What?! Why?

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:37.540
Because a piti-phant straight man

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:37.540
would make everything sad.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:38.620
Is that what you want?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:40.750
Like, sad how?

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.750
The sofa flew so-far away!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.330
Of course they died!

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:49.580
They're dead...

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:53.660
All we can do is watch over the poor thing.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:54.620
Let's go.

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.790
I'm so sorry.

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:05.950
I'm on camera!

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:07.160
You're right!

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:10.540
Yui, I'm going to close my eyes. 

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:14.540
You keep an eye on video me

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:14.540
to make sure she doesn't move on her own.

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:16.410
I'm going to hold still.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.370
What? That's silly. 

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.290
She wouldn't just start moving on her-

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.000
She moved!

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:23.410
For real?

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.080
Kotoha, too!

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.330
Really?

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:30.500
Oh, no! Video Kotoha!

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:34.540
Video Kotoha defeated Video Sat-chan!

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:37.790
Video Kotoha is trampling all over her!

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:39.450
Turn around, Leader!

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:42.120
Video Kotoha is gloating!

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.910
Please turn around, Leader!

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:54.040
We still haven't found anything that feels just right.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:54.870
Not yet.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.700
Which way do we go?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.790
First let's go to the very top!

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:19.450
Are these real?

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:22.200
Yes. Real taxidermy.

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.410
What's taxidermy?

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.250
Do the animals have an operation

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.250
or something after they die?

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.500
They aren't dead.

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:29.370
What?

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:31.950
They've just been given a shot

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:31.950
to make sure they don't move.

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:33.330
They're actually alive.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.500
What?!

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:49.450
But if the animals here moved,

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:49.450
the zoo would go out of business.

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:53.120
So they made a backroom deal with the zoo

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:53.120
and promised to keep them from moving.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:54.830
Backroom deal?

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:58.790
It says right here these pandas used to live at the zoo.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:01.330
That's proof of their backroom deal.

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:02.700
I see.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.750
It's not just the piti-phants. Pandas, too.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.540
How dare they.

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:09.950
If they're alive but they can't move...

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:11.660
they can't poop!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.910
But why?!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:25.160
E-even if they can't move,

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:25.160
if they try hard enough, they can still go poo.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:28.950
Let's go to the next one!

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:35.540
Taxidermy's a little scary. 

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.950
Let's look at something that's just bones next.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.040
I thought you were scared of bones, too.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.200
I-I'm okay with them now!

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.750
Looks like there's bones on Basement 1.

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:52.370
Explore the Mysteries

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:52.370
of the Dinosaurs

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:51.620
What's with that pose?

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.450
This is incredible.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:06.750
There are dinosaurs everywhere!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.080
They're much bigger than that first one.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.500
It's a Tyrannosaurus.

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:16.200
Let's go with this one.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:16.910
Huh?

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:18.580
For the new member of Colors.

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:20.160
Oh! I like it!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.500
Do you girls like dinosaurs?

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.620
Who goes there?!

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:27.290
Just someone who works here.

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:30.120
They put you on display?

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:33.000
What? No, I'm not a display.

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:37.950
I choose what exhibits to display, and I research them.

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:41.910
I'm a big fan of dinosaurs, myself.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.160
This sitting skeleton specimen...

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:53.290
Oh, by which I mean the Tyrannosaurus lying in wait here

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:53.290
is the only exhibit of its kind anywhere in the world.

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.040
You're a dinosaur professor!

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:57.160
Oh, he's right, it is sitting!

00:10:57.160 --> 00:10:58.580
Is it taking a break?

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:01.500
It's about to attack.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:07.700
They say the T-rex captured its prey

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:07.700
with its enormous jaws and sharp teeth.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:09.790
I see. So it's the strongest.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.040
It IS strongest.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.200
So can it...

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:14.120
play it straight?

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:15.870
Play it straight?

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.370
Good question. 

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:20.950
Some people say it was a slow creature.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:25.120
But I believe it dauntlessly charged straight for its prey.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.620
Oh! So it CAN be a straight man.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:28.790
Let's go with it!

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:29.660
Yeah!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:30.830
It's settled.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.120
We'll take three, please!

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:39.660
They wouldn't let us have any.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.540
A bunch of misers!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.500
But the museum was pretty fun.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:47.660
Even if our mission for a new teammate was a bust.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:50.870
We'll just need Yui to get better

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:50.870
at playing the straight man.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:52.750
I AM good at it!

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.000
So let's go to the museum again!

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.750
England's museum!

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:58.450
But why?!

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.950
W-we'd have to go out of our way to get on a plane.

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.040
Am I right?

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:14.000
Year-End

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:14.000
Sale

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.500
Have some tissues!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:21.330
I'm telling you, it's elephants!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:24.870
No, lions! They're the king of beasts!

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:27.160
What animal do you think is strongest, Kotoha?

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:28.620
The Mob.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:31.120
The Mob isn't an animal.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.580
They didn't have any of them at the museum, either.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.620
The mobster species of the mammal Elephantidae

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.620
is the strongest.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:38.250
See? I told you it was elephants!

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:41.000
Then the mobster species of the mammal lion.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.370
Lions are felines.

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:47.040
Lottery

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:47.040
Raffle

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:49.750
Raffle

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:49.750
Lottery

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:49.750
Area

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.580
It's a spinny box!

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:55.290
Oh, you're right! They're doing a lottery!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.370
Kotoha!

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:59.040
Why are you doing a lottery?

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:59.040
Is it your hobby? Huh? Is it?

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.200
Huh? It's not my hobby.

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:03.370
You're not even doing it for fun?

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:05.330
Uh... Why...?

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.500
What's the first prize?

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.540
Is it a head? I bet it's a head.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:11.660
A head?! What is wrong with you people?!

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:14.330
Everyone knows that first place is always a head.

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:15.250
Really?

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:19.200
I don't know what you're talking about

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:19.200
with this "head" business, but...

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.000
First prize is...

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:23.000
Believe it or not!

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.290
Hawaii!

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.000
Ba-bam!

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:31.080
So this is a job?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.790
Uh, yes'm, it's a job!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.370
Do you like your job?

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.580
Eh, it's not bad.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:38.370
She says it's Hawaii!

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:40.370
First prize is a Hawaii head!

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.620
Lottery Raffle

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.620
Lottery Ticket

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:45.580
Right now, if you make a purchase

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:45.580
