00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:49.370
you will be given a lottery ticket as pictured here.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:54.080
Once you collect five tickets, you may enjoy

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:54.080
one chance to win a prize in the lottery.

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:55.700
Did you memorize that spiel?

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.250
Huh? Uh, yes.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:58.750
Lemme spin the box!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.950
I wish you would have listened to my spiel.

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:03.870
Aw, Pops's store isn't on here.

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:05.620
Sasaki Bread is on the list.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:07.040
Nonoka's shop!

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:09.620
Okay! Off to Sasaki Bread!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.000
Yeah!

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:12.790
See ya, part-timer!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:13.750
Okay.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.870
Oh, so THEY'RE Colors!

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:25.160
Lottery tickets!

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:26.450
Lottery tickets!

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:28.040
Lottery tickets!

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.700
Sasaki Bread

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:40.120
Prepared

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:40.120
Breads

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:40.120
Sandwiches

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:32.200
Lottery tickets?

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:34.700
Yeah, our shop's participating.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:36.000
Yay!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.870
You saw a girl at the spinning box, right?

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:41.580
She's my friend from school.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.410
Her name's Subaru.

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:45.700
She has so many jobs, she might get held back a year.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.370
Cool.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.660
Well, I guess you don't care. 

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:53.910
Yeah, sorry.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.330
Nonoka! Give us lottery tickets!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.080
I knew you would ask.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.500
That's why I tried to change the subject.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:04.580
You can't have any.

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:08.040
Those tickets are for paying customers.

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:11.040
Nonoka's kinda mean today.

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:14.870
Because Yui didn't care about her pointless story.

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:17.330
Well, it was pointless.

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:19.500
I can super hear you.

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:22.540
I know! How about this, Nonoka?

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:23.330
What?

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:25.660
We'll help out at the bakery!

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:28.200
And when we're done, will you give us lottery tickets?

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:29.870
Oh, of course!

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.870
I don't need any help.

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:34.910
Aw!

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:35.830
Why not?

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.120
We're not that busy right now.

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:42.700
Besides, I think if I let YOU help,

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:42.700
it will turn into a big mess.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.370
It won't be a mess! It will be great!

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:48.950
Say the girls who ate onigiri in my bread shop.

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:50.790
How long ago was that?

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:53.330
Stupid miser Nonoka! I hope you're held back a year!

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.000
Subaru's the one getting held back!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:59.040
Anyway, I have all the help I need, so forget about it.

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:04.000
Forget about it!

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.330
Okay, I got it, Nonoka.

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:08.790
You do, Koto-chan?

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:11.950
Give us those lottery tickets

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:11.950
and we'll promise not to help.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.450
What?!

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:14.950
Oh, good idea!

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:17.700
This way we all win.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.250
Okay, Nonoka! Give us those tickets!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.370
No, uh...

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:23.450
Huh?

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:27.910
Wha...?

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:31.620
Prepared

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:31.620
Breads

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:31.620
Sandwiches

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:34.040
Lottery

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:34.040
Ticket

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:33.450
We got three tickets!

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.410
Now we need two more.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.040
Nono-chan, thank you!

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:42.080
Well, let's just not worry about the details anymore.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.000
How do we get the last two?

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.500
I have an idea.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:51.700
Surely some of the people who made purchases

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:51.700
don't want their tickets.

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:53.580
We'll get our tickets from them.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:55.200
That IS a good idea!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.790
That's our Koto-chan!

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:00.450
But do you think they'll give them to us if we just ask?

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:01.330
I know!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.200
I just had an idea, too!

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:05.950
Tissues, please!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.000
Here you go.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.200
More! More!

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:13.250
Wow!

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:15.830
What are you going to do with all those tissues?

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.700
We'll use them for trading!

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:19.580
Oh, of course!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:23.950
Okay! Time for Operation: Tissues for Tickets!

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:25.160
Yeah!

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.540
Here you go.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.830
They're handing them out for me.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:34.450
Here you go.

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:36.580
Hey! Hand over your lottery ticket!

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:37.410
Huh?

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.250
H-have some tissues.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.120
Thank you.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.370
Uh, um...

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.330
Lottery ticket...

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:54.790
If you don't trade your lottery tickets for this,

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:57.580
your relationship will end before

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:57.580
the bell rings in the New Year.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:58.830
What?

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:02.910
Lot-ter-y tic-ket!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:04.950
Have some tissues!

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:07.790
Here, some tissues!

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:15.120
Huh? Why am I handing these out again?

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.870
You stepped on that. You better pay for it.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.000
Any luck?

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.080
Everyone ran away.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.910
They're all a bunch of misers.

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:30.410
This calls for...

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:32.750
Killer move!

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.410
Pocket tissue...

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:35.660
Attack!

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:38.290
What in the world?

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:38.870
Oh!

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:40.500
Colors, it's you!

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.000
Oh, hi, Moka!

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.250
It's you, Moka!

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:44.620
What are you doing?

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.620
Pocket Tissue Attack!

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:48.620
Pocket tissue attack?

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:52.580
We wanted to trade the tissues for lottery tickets.

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:55.080
But we couldn't find anyone who would trade.

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:56.660
Lottery tickets?

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:58.790
Oh, you mean these?

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.370
Oh! Yes!

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:01.910
The exact number we need!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.120
Very well. I will tr-

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.790
Okay, girls! Pocket Tissue Attack!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.540
H-hold on, wait a minute!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:12.040
You don't have to attack! I'm willing to trade!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:12.870
Really?

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:14.040
You are?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:14.750
Yes!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:16.120
Yay!

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:17.700
Now, now, stop throwing them.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:19.450
Thank you so much, Moka!

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:23.080
In exchange, no more Pocket Tissue Attack.

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.040
Okay?

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.540
Got it! I don't think I'll ever do it again!

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:29.000
That sounds like you definitely will.

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:32.700
Bye-bye, Moka!

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:35.160
Okay, off to the lottery!

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:38.450
Good grief.

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.870
Yup, that's five tickets.

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:42.830
Lottery

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:42.830
Ticket

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.450
Nice work collecting them, Colors!

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:52.290
Lottery

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.000
It's up to you, Leader!

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.660
Win us that Hawaii head!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:49.700
You got it!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:52.000
Oh, they aren't listening at all, are they?

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:53.790
Okay!

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:01.200
Well, anyway, give it a spin!

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:09.790
Faster, Leader!

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:12.790
Don't spin it too fast - it won't help the balls come out!

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:15.160
Faster! Faster!

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:19.080
Oh, I guess you still aren't listening.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:35.700
There it is!

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:36.500
It's red!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.830
That's my color!

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:40.200
Leader's color! That means...

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:45.870
Two tickets to Hawaii

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:45.870
Lottery

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:45.330
Congratulations!

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:52.750
Fifth prize!

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:54.700
Pocket tissue!

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:00.040
Here you go!

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.620
Pocket Tissue Attack!

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:24.500
Kirari aizu wa ichiban-boshi

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:26.540
Otto sorosoro kaennakya

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:27.580
Otsu Colors

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:28.660
Otsu Colors

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:31.750
Kyou mo heiwa wa mamorareta

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:32.500
Yatta!

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:35.750
Wareware no kanzen shouri da!

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:38.910
Sanpochuu no chuu chuu kaburira

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:40.870
Kurae! Extra virgin oil!

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:44.700
Mainichi oo isogashi

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:47.040
Jiken level ichi kara doko made?

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:49.040
Donna nazo demo kaiketsu shichau yo

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.160
Game clear!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.080
Clear kita!

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:53.040
Mata pinch no toki wa yobu to ii!

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:56.250
Kono machi no heiwa no tame ni!

00:21:56.410 --> 00:22:00.910
Orange no sora to yooi don shite

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:04.830
Issho ni ouchi e kaerou

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:09.040
Kitto ashita mo unto wakuwaku motto dekiru yo ne

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:11.870
Zen'in ajito dash de shuugou

00:22:12.500 --> 00:22:17.120
Sayonara taiyou machi mo oyasumi

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:21.200
Ashita ga machidooshii na

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:25.250
Skip kokoro ga ukiuki tomaranai

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:29.580
Honjitsu mo ijou nashi!

00:22:29.580 --> 00:22:32.160
Mata ashita

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:33.700
Mou ikkai

00:22:33.700 --> 00:22:38.080
Mata ashita

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:43.790
Colors Evaluation Meeting now in session!

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:45.660
You're still doing that?

00:22:45.830 --> 00:22:47.910
It's just a fancy word for "preview."

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.200
Like, two episodes ago, Yui just called it a preview.

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:55.290
That was a mistake! I meant to say evaluation meeting!

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:58.580
But I think the one with the most to work on

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:58.580
after today is you, Yui.

00:22:58.580 --> 00:23:00.080
Yup, definitely Yui.

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:01.580
Huh? Oh!

00:23:02.620 --> 00:23:04.200
But why?!

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:07.620
Yui. That wasn't the time for that.

00:23:07.620 --> 00:23:10.160
What? You weren't joking? You meant that?

00:23:10.160 --> 00:23:13.620
We sure did. And that last part was the worst.

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:17.080
You got hit with your own Pocket Tissue Attack.

00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:20.910
What? But I can't control the lottery. It's all luck.

00:23:20.910 --> 00:23:24.540
Isn't there any way to make SURE

00:23:20.910 --> 00:23:24.540
you win first place in those lotteries?

00:23:24.540 --> 00:23:26.370
Have a robot spin the box.

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:28.660
A robot would definitely win first prize.

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:30.580
Oh, of course!

00:23:30.580 --> 00:23:33.910
Okay! Then next episode, let's get us a robot!

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:38.250
Yes. One that will obey even the cruelest of commands.

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:40.790
Kotoha, what are you going to do with it?
